MicroEMACS 3.6 -- Atari Quick Reference
ESC = META prefix  ^X = Ctrl-X prefix

--- CURSOR MOVEMENT ---
^F / ^B     Forward / Backward char
^N / ^P     Next / Previous line
^A / ^E     Start / End of line
^V / ^Z     Scroll down / up one screen
M-< / M->   Beginning / End of file
M-G         Go to line number

--- EDITING ---
DEL         Delete previous character
^D          Delete next character
^K          Kill to end of line
^O          Open (insert) blank line
^L          Refresh (redraw) screen

--- CUT AND PASTE ---
M-SPACE     Set MARK at cursor
^Y          Yank (paste) kill buffer

--- SEARCH ---
^S          Search forward (end: ESC)

--- FILES ---
^X^F        Find/open file
^X^R        Read file into curr buffer
^X^S        Save current buffer
^X^W        Write buffer to new filename
^X =        Show cursor position

--- BUFFERS ---
^X B        Switch to named buffer
^X X        Cycle to next buffer
^X K        Kill (delete) a buffer
^X D        Directory listing (Dired)

--- EXIT ---
^X^C / M-Z  Exit MicroEMACS (confirms if unsaved changes)
^G          Cancel current command

--- HELP ---
M-?         Show this help screen
